            <div class="wrapper flex items-center justify-between gap-[20px] md:flex-col">
               <div class="project-name range-1 [--minv-1:12] [--maxv-1:22] px-[--range-1]">
                  <p class="range-fs [--minv-fs:16] [--maxv-fs:18] [font-size:--range-fs] leading-tight text-black/50 [&_a]:duration-300 [&_a]:text-black/50 [&_a:hover]:text-black">Tüm hakları saklıdır. <a href="index.html">Project Name</a></p>
